// Complete Lacuna Deck Language 0.5.0 example.
# Selectables

## person
>english;japanese
Alice;アリス
Bob;ボブ

## countable_noun
>english;e_plural;japanese
apple;apples;りんご
banana;bananas;バナナ

## color
>english;japanese
blue;青
red;赤

## phrase
>key;english;japanese
greeting;"She said ""hello""; then left.";彼女は言いました。

# Groups
_alice;person;english;{Alice}
people;person;english;{Alice,Bob}
fruits;countable_noun;english;{apple,banana}
colors;color;english;{blue,red}
greetings;phrase;key;{greeting}

# Pair Groups

## wrong_colors
>object=group;color=selectable:color:english
fruits;blue

# Templates

## lesson_1
>english;^japanese;~notes
>vocab;countable_noun;english;{banana}
>vocab;color;english;{blue}

{
    <wrong_colors:object:e_plural> are not <wrong_colors:color:english>.
    <wrong_colors:object:japanese>は<wrong_colors:color:japanese>ではありません。
"Contrast: ""not blue""; vocabulary note."
}

{
    [greetings:english]
    [greetings:japanese]
    [greetings:english]
}

{
    [_alice:english] studies.
    [_alice:japanese]は勉強します。
    Person: [_alice:english].
}
